* Edit 3: Add a common-gate stage at input to lower input impedance and enhance matching.
C C4 VIN1 n5
NMOS NM4 n5 n6 VSS VSS  # Common-gate stage to present low input impedance
L L1 n6 n1
NMOS NM1 n2 n1 VSS VSS
C C1 n1 n3
PMOS PM1 n2 n3 VDD VDD
L L2 n2 n4
C C2 n4 VSS
C C3 n2 VOUT1
R R1 VDD n7
NMOS NM3 n7 n7 VSS VSS
R R2 n7 n1
PMOS PM2 n8 n8 VDD VDD
R R4 n8 VSS
R R5 n8 n3